# The repo-root .gitignore is Python's, and its virtualenv section carries a
# bare `lib/` — which matches ANY directory of that name, including this app's
# src/lib. Nothing complains: the build passes locally because the files are on
# disk, and only CI, checking out what git actually has, discovers they were
# never committed.
!src/lib/

node_modules
dist
.wrangler
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
